       <div class="ch">
<h1>Tunnel Diode Oscillator with a Bias Network</h1>

<div class="ch-card">
<h2>Circuit Components</h2>
<p>The circuit is drawn in three blocks, as in the classical textbook figure:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Bias circuit:</strong> battery <em>Vb</em> = 1.5 V, switch <em>SW</em> (<em>SwitchSPST</em>, <em>state</em> = 1: closed), series resistor <em>R1</em> = 60 Ω and shunt resistor <em>Rs</em> = 12 Ω. They form a voltage divider that sets the operating point of the diode</li>
<li><strong>Tunnel diode (TD):</strong> <em>TunnelDiode</em>, I<sub>p</sub> = 5 mA at V<sub>p</sub> = 0.1 V. The anode is on the node <em>A</em> (the divider) and the cathode on the node <em>T</em></li>
<li><strong>Tank circuit:</strong> <em>Cr</em> = 100 pF and <em>Lr</em> = 1 µH in parallel, from <em>T</em> to ground</li>
<li><strong>Load:</strong> <em>RL</em> = 1 kΩ from <em>T</em> to ground</li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2>Principle</h2>
<p>Between its peak (0.10 V, 5.00 mA) and its valley (0.43 V, 1.15 mA) the tunnel diode has a <strong>negative resistance</strong>: the current decreases when the voltage increases. The steepest slope is −18.2 mS, that is −55 Ω.</p>

<div class="ch-grid">
<div class="ch-col blue">
<h3>DC: the operating point</h3>
<ul>
<li>The divider is equivalent to a source <span><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 2.1963em; vertical-align: -0.836em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">b</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.3603em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.314em;"><span class=